---
// Signpost to the step-by-step install guide. Most people who write
// requirements for a living have never added a plugin marketplace before, so
// every page that shows install commands also offers the long version.
---

<a
	href="/toolkit/install"
	class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-[16px] border border-line-2 bg-white p-5 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-accent-softer max-[760px]:flex-col max-[760px]:items-start max-[760px]:gap-3"
>
	<span
		class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-[20px]"
		aria-hidden="true">🧭</span
	>
	<span class="flex-1">
		<span class="block text-[17px] font-extrabold text-accent-ink">
			Never installed a plugin before?
		</span>
		<span class="mt-1 block text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2">
			No terminal experience assumed. The step-by-step guide walks through
			installing Claude Code or Codex, adding the marketplace, and checking it
			worked — plus a no-install route that is just copy and paste.
		</span>
	</span>
	<span
		class="shrink-0 font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-accent transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"
	>
		Open the guide →
	</span>
</a>
